  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "<p>Kedge Business School is an International Business School mainly based in Bordeaux, Marseille and Paris. It is a triple accredited French business school that has been ranked as the 8th best business school in France by Challenges. KBS has a large international community, with over 1000 international students attending each year. The school offers numerous programmes in fields such as Digital Marketing, Finance, and International Business that are recognised around the world for their quality.</p> <p>Kedge Business School provides first-rate facilities such as 57 technologically-equipped classrooms, six auditoriums, 22 ‘brain bubbles’: study areas, and four catering areas providing a range of cuisine. There is a state-of-the-art fitness centre, a new incubator dedicated to business start-ups, 20 association rooms and lots of outdoor space. The Hub on campus contains a Wellness Centre, Business Nursery, cafe and yoga space.</p><p>Marseille and Bordeaux campuses provide plenty of student associations for international students to engage in, whether that’s political, religious, sports or in hobby-related fields. The campus is known for its strong focus on community and the arts, as well as providing dedicated spaces for students to carve out business plans and work in shared spaces.</p>"
    ],
